acceptance_criteria: "pm vcs remote adds, lists and removes named remotes; remote names are validated as safe single path segments before they become part of a ref name; tracking refs read back under refs/remotes/<remote>/<branch>; the remote list survives a reopen; adding a duplicate name is refused rather than silently overwriting"
